WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.156
It was early one evening.

2
00:00:06.157 --> 00:00:12.562
Principal Penn and the teachers were arriving at Metro City Grand Hotel.

3
00:00:12.563 --> 00:00:18.049
A mysterious man named Mr. Sweeps had invited them to a special meeting.

4
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.977
"Maybe he's going to donate money to the school," thought Principal Penn.

5
00:00:23.978 --> 00:00:27.085
"Welcome," said Mr. Sweeps.

6
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:33.939
"Please take a button."

7
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.178
Principal Penn pinned a star button onto her jacket.

8
00:00:37.179 --> 00:00:39.305
Then she sat down.

9
00:00:39.306 --> 00:00:41.997
"Now," said Mr. Sweeps. "Let

10
00:00:41.998 --> 00:00:53.111
me tell you why I invited you here . . ." *

11
00:00:53.112 --> 00:00:55.535
* * It was a beautiful

12
00:00:55.536 --> 00:00:58.548
fall morning. Roxy and her friends were walking

13
00:00:58.549 --> 00:01:01.909
