said Terrell. "I'm worried we won't be able to go to the zoo,"

17
00:01:13.562 --> 00:01:16.350
said Mara. "My mom told me our school

18
00:01:16.351 --> 00:01:20.564
needs money. The field trip to the zoo might

19
00:01:20.565 --> 00:01:24.126
be canceled." "That would be awful!"

20
00:01:24.127 --> 00:01:26.829
said Jack. "We should do something

21
00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:29.680
to help." "What can we do?"

22
00:01:29.681 --> 00:01:32.099
asked Mara. "We don't have

23
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.486
any money." "Maybe Rocket Girl can help,"

24
00:01:36.487 --> 00:01:39.514
said Terrell. "I don't think so,"

25
00:01:39.515 --> 00:01:42.511
said Roxy. "Rocket Girl doesn't have

26
00:01:42.512 --> 00:01:46.226
money." "Rocket Girl can do anything," said

27
00:01:46.227 --> 00:01:49.004
Terrell. "She's the greatest superhero

28
00:01:49.005 --> 00:01:52.302
ever!" Roxy

29
00:01:52.303 --> 00:01:55.415
shrugged. Soon Roxy and her friends reached

30
00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:57.752
school. Roxy looked at the parking

31
00:01:57.753 --> 00:02:06.207
lot. "Where are all the teachers' cars?" she

32
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:11.818
wondered. "Welcome, students!" said a man at the school

33
00:02:11.819 --> 00:02:15.059
entrance. He was handing out star-shaped

34
00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:19.148
buttons. "I'm Mr. Sweeps, your substitute principal

35
00:02:19.149 --> 00:02:24.771
today. Principal Penn is . . . um . . . busy doing other

36
00:02:24.772 --> 00:02:27.911
things." Roxy looked at Mr. Sweeps

37
00:02:27.912 --> 00:02:31.765
suspiciously. Something about the substitute principal seemed

38
00:02:31.766 --> 00:02:35.838
odd. "Cool! Thanks for the button!" said

39
00:02:35.839 --> 00:02:38.990
Jack. Mr. Sweeps handed one to

40
00:02:38.991 --> 00:02:41.880
Roxy. "Here you go, young lady," he

41
00:02:41.881 --> 00:02:45.934
said. "Thanks," said Roxy, carefully looking at the

42
00:02:45.935 --> 00:02:50.503
button. "Go ahead, put it on," said Mr.

43
00:02:50.504 --> 00:02:53.388
Sweeps. Just then Roxy heard her watch beep.

44
00:02:53.389 --> 00:02:55.683
She put the button in her pocket.

45
00:02:55.684 --> 00:03:02.096
Then she hurried away from the school's entrance.

46
00:03:02.097 --> 00:03:06.801
Roxy pressed a button on her watch.

47
00:03:06.802 --> 00:03:10.793
"Mayor Bloom," she said. "What's wrong?"

48
00:03:10.794 --> 00:03:13.949
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl," said the mayor.

49
00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.282
